        padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.45; color: #1d2939;
        background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 38, 72, 0.12); border-left-width: 4px;
    }
